################ base
value >= 0 and value <= 255        accepted       
value >= -5                        refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
-5 <= value                        refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value > -5 and value < 5           refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value == -3                        refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value != -3                        refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 1 or value <= -1          refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 2 + 3                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= -(5)                      refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= - -5                      refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= (-5)                      refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 0 - 5                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 2 * 3                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 10 / 2                    refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 7 % 4                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= n                         refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 5 - value                 refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value + 1 >= 5                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= -5 and value <= -10       refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= -5.0                      refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
################ grammar
value >= 0 and value <= 255        accepted       
value >= -5                        accepted       
-5 <= value                        accepted       
value > -5 and value < 5           accepted       
value == -3                        refused(rc=1)  
value != -3                        accepted       
value >= 1 or value <= -1          accepted       
value >= 2 + 3                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= -(5)                      accepted       
value >= - -5                      accepted       
value >= (-5)                      accepted       
value >= 0 - 5                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 2 * 3                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 10 / 2                    refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 7 % 4                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= n                         refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= 5 - value                 refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value + 1 >= 5                     refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
value >= -5 and value <= -10       refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement admits no values at all
value >= -5.0                      refused(rc=1)  error: this refinement is not a predicate the checker can read
